              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <span class="small text-muted fw-bold">Penalty enter karke "Save Penalties" par click karein. Total Balance me auto add ho jayegi!</span>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-3 text-end">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-success btn-sm fw-bold px-4" onclick="saveSectionPenalties('<%= sec %>')">
                  💾 Save Penalties
                </button>
